{"id": "70127", "title": "重生之修复师", "author": "络缤", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 39, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70127/70127s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70127.htm", "intro": "其实这就是一个【认真的傻瓜】经过努力，从此过上幸福生活的故事。\r\n    郭启辞唯一一次反抗父亲，坚持和贫寒的庄卓结婚，最终让他尝到了苦果。\r\n    伏低做小三年，换来的却是背叛。那个曾经信誓旦旦说深爱他的男人，不过是贪图他的家世罢了。\r\n    重生到八年前，他被父亲接到了城里，生活发生翻天覆地的变化。此世意外获得修复系统，命运从此与上辈子截然不同。\r\n    就在他以为找到属于自己的光明时，父亲把他‘嫁’给传说外表男神内心残暴冷血的男人。\r\n    这次他是反抗还是顺从？", "base": "files/article/html/70/70127", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第1章", "file": "10845506.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章", "file": "10845507.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章", "file": "10845508.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章", "file": "10845509.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章", "file": "10845510.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6章", "file": "10845511.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7章", "file": "10845512.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8章", "file": "10845513.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9章", "file": "10845514.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10章", "file": "10845515.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11章", "file": "10845516.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12章", "file": "10845517.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13章", "file": "10845518.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14章", "file": "10845519.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15章", "file": "10845520.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16章", "file": "10845521.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17章", "file": "10845522.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18章", "file": "10845523.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19章", "file": "10845524.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20章", "file": "10845525.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21章", "file": "10845526.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22章", "file": "10845527.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23章", "file": "10845528.h